  "name": "Snowman",
  "description": "A snowman sits in the grid, surrounded by snowy cells that hide boxes. Playing a box melts every snowy cell next to it, so you choose which hidden boxes to uncover and when. When all his snow is gone, the snowman waves goodbye and leaves a box behind.",
